    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.replace, mini.diagnostic\n\n### Description\n\nHi again! I wanted to know if there are any plans on implementing project wide search and replace plugin in the mini lib. Also a diagnostics plugin like trouble.nvim combined with todo-comments.nvim.",
