        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "So doing <C-a><M-CR> pushes the content to the quickfix list.\r\nHow can those keymaps be combined into one? (<C-q> for example)?\r\nI've been trying to define such keymap but I think the MiniPick actions are not public.\r\n\r\nedit: that was easy:\r\n```lua\r\n      mappings = {\r\n\r\n        to_quickfix = {\r\n          char = \"<C-q>\",\r\n          func = function()\r\n            local items = MiniPick.get_picker_items() or {}\r\n            MiniPick.default_choose_marked(items)\r\n            MiniPick.stop()\r\n          end,\r\n        },\r\n      },\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2024-03-21T13:19:21Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/744#issuecomment-2012276351",
            "id": 2012276351,
